== Introduction ==
I am [[User:Yubam|Jae]], Yubam ingame, or jae.zip on Discord, and here's my information dump on how to construct a max efficiency setup for [[Tombs of Amascut]]. The setup that you should bring will vary wildly depending on what invocations are on, and who you are raiding with, so I will try to provide as much information as to what you should consider for your setup. For now, I am only writing information regarding max gear, but I may add more in the future when I have time. 

This was created on March 1st, 2025. Future items may change setups (such as [[Avernic treads]], or [[Surge potion]])

